  "description": "REVISED DRAWINGS RECEIVED: \rVariation of Conditions 2 (approved plans), of planning permission 22/01981/FUL (Refurbishment and conversion of St Mary's Hall (Use Class F1) to provide community hall (Use Class F2(b)) and a gym (Use Class E(d)) at ground floor level and 9 residential units (Use Class C3) at first and second floor level, including erection of an additional storey, the replacement of the ground floor side extension, plus the provision of refuse and cycle storage, along with other associated works) granted 04.04.2024. \rAmendments to include: Access to the cycle store being off St Alphonsus Road; Mechanical Plant being relocated to undercroft next to residential fire exit; former cycle store being incorporated into Pilates studio area; erection of plant room next to entrance on Great Acre Court; replacement of gym cycle store with a plant area; step free access to the community hall being combined with the fire exit on St Alphonsus Road; Internal alterations to address the level changes and minor associated alterations. \r",
